    - target: {fileID: 5912584211440286702, guid: 7cc92fc86676e914d87ddb821614609c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "YUKARIDA AKT\u0130F \xC7ALI\u015EMA YAPILMAKTADIR. OLASI TEHL\u0130KELERDEN
        UZAKLA\u015EMAK \u0130\xC7\u0130N \u0130SKELEDEN UZAK DURUNUZ!\n\nYukar\u0131dan
        Malzeme D\xFC\u015Fme Riski: El aletleri, tu\u011Fla, moloz ve har\xE7 par\xE7alar\u0131n\u0131n
        d\xFC\u015Fmesi sonucu ciddi ba\u015F ve v\xFCcut yaralanmalar\u0131 ya\u015Fanabilir.\n\n\u0130skele
        Eleman\u0131 D\xFC\u015Fme Riski: Sabitlenmemi\u015F kelep\xE7e, kalas ve
        ba\u011Flant\u0131 par\xE7alar\u0131n\u0131n yerinden \xE7\u0131kma tehlikesi
        bulunmaktad\u0131r.\n\nBaret Kullan\u0131m\u0131 Zorunludur: Ba\u015F b\xF6lgesini
        darbe ve a\u011F\u0131r yaralanmalardan korumak i\xE7in koruyucu baret olmadan
        alanda bulunmay\u0131n."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
